    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CAEMDALE</strong> is a roguelike deckbuilder where every decision shapes the fate of your growing city. As you construct new buildings, you'll unlock powerful cards that define your strategy. Carefully chosen <strong>state policies</strong> offer deeper synergy with your deck, enabling new combinations.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720630/extras/b0918663c64be2bbc1abf08f48391ab0.poster.avif?t=1749991243\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720630/extras/b0918663c64be2bbc1abf08f48391ab0.webm?t=1749991243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720630/extras/b0918663c64be2bbc1abf08f48391ab0.mp4?t=1749991243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Increase your Prestige</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While building your deck, you must defend your city against relentless <strong>raids</strong> and withstand disruptive <strong>revolutions</strong> that will demolish your deck if they are not prepared for. Manage these challenges to make sure you are prepared to build the critical <strong>prestige</strong> buildings to establish a true empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720630/extras/4e2a5faad016ec328812403e5cbea8d5.poster.avif?t=1749991243\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720630/extras/4e2a5faad016ec328812403e5cbea8d5.webm?t=1749991243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720630/extras/4e2a5faad016ec328812403e5cbea8d5.mp4?t=1749991243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udccf 50+ cards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720630/extras/6919af0818870043105076b8ef1b45e8.avif?t=1749991243\" width=671 height=319 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your strategy to the cards you unlock each game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f 40+ buildings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720630/extras/e80a60fdd4f322245fde1c6bbb78dce8.avif?t=1749991243\" width=671 height=319 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete buildings to unlock more powerful cards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcdc 20+ state policies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720630/extras/21bc6c3411683d5b18e113deabadd933.avif?t=1749991243\" width=671 height=319 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the right policies to synergise with your deck</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 10+ revolutions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720630/extras/5a0419f3a17c38c2ea7558dcd1419148.avif?t=1749991243\" width=671 height=319 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for the revolutions that will mess with your deck</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
